    ["5230302   神秘空间   位面"] = "5230302 Mysterious Space - Plane",
    ["8月11日晚上8点，铁十字街下街以糊制火柴盒为生的劳维斯太太突发疾病死亡。\n8月11日晚上10点，码头工人齐德跳入塔索克河，结束了贫穷的生命\n8月11日晚上11点，西区济贫院内，破产的索尔斯企图纵火，制造惨案，但最终只烧死了自己。\n8月12号下午3点，码头工厂区海莉叶突然倒地死亡。\n……"] = "August 11th, 8:00 PM, Mrs. Lowis, who made a living by gluing matchboxes on Lower Street, Iron Cross Street, died suddenly of an illness.\nAugust 11th, 10:00 PM, dock worker Zide jumped into the Tussock River, ending his life of poverty.\nAugust 11th, 11:00 PM, inside the West District Poorhouse, the bankrupt Sols attempted to commit arson to create a tragedy, but in the end, only burned himself to death.\nAugust 12th, 3:00 PM, dock factory area, Hayley suddenly collapsed and died.\n...",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【大地的恩赐】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，同场景持续佩戴后死亡会在原地生成黑面草之地，为友方提供<Assistant_Red>持续治疗</>、<Assistant_Red>攻击提升</>和<Assistant_Red>免控</>次数；黑面草之地存在期间无法主动复活或被队友复活，尸体被强制净化时只保留生命恢复效果。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本-记忆的传承·邦尼（困难）首通奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gift of the Earth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. After wearing it continuously in the same scene, dying will generate a patch of Black-Faced Grass on the spot, providing allies with <Assistant_Red>Continuous healing</>, <Assistant_Red>Attack Boost</>, and <Assistant_Red>Control Immunity</> charges. You cannot actively resurrect or be resurrected by teammates while the Black-Faced Grass patch exists. If the corpse is forcibly purified, only the health recovery effect remains.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-clear reward for Dungeon - Legacy of Memory: Bonnie (Hard).",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>银光锦缎・华美皮草\n将寒风缀于肩头，胜利的容光不惧任何凛冽冰雪。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Silver Brocade · Gorgeous Fur\nAdorn your shoulders with the cold wind; the radiance of victory fears no biting ice or snow.",
