    ["<P_Heart>（从零钱箱里随手拿出几枚零钱）</>车票和找零请收好。还有半小时发车，您可以在候车区等一会儿。"] = "<P_Heart> (casually takes some change from the cash box) </> Here is your ticket and change. The train leaves in half an hour, you can wait in the waiting area for a while.",
