    ["<Yellow>纸人庇护</>：主人受到致命伤害时，触发<Yellow>8</>秒的纸人庇护效果，期间纸人代主人承受过量伤害，提高主人的控制闪避<Yellow>*d</>和控制抵挡<Yellow>*d</>，使主人免疫移动速度降低效果。纸人承受的过量伤害总额不超过主人生命值上限的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</>。达到上限时，庇护效果提前结束。\n庇护效果每120秒最多触发一次。"] = "<Yellow>Paper Figurine Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Paper Figurine Protection effect. During this time, the paper figurine absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to movement speed reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the paper figurine cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds.",
